This product is unofficial. The Nigerian Postal Service (NIPOST) did not make it and does not endorse it.
Gatepost uses the name NIPOST only to describe compatibility with NIPOST's National Digital Postcode.

The plugin bundles gatepost/postcode (Apache-2.0) and these packages under the MIT licence: nyholm/psr7,
psr/http-client, psr/http-factory, psr/http-message and psr/simple-cache. It also bundles the
Composer autoloader (MIT). Each bundled package keeps its licence file in vendor-prefixed/.

The bundled gatepost/postcode also holds data from the Unicode Character Database in
vendor-prefixed/gatepost/postcode/src/Internal/NfkcTable.php. The Unicode License v3 covers it.
The licence text is in vendor-prefixed/gatepost/postcode/LICENSES/Unicode-3.0.txt.
